From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Add MT6357 battery current sensing

Expose signed current using the stock latch and conversion sequence. Check
engine readiness, serialize sampling, bound polling and recover failed
releases before accepting another sample. Preserve the stock shunt and gain
units without changing charger or gauge engine state.

